    "detailed_description": "You know what really killed the dinosaurs? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMewMew PewPew is a wave-based arena shooter, where you play as MewMew, whose home is invaded by vengeful dinosaurs. Destroy your enemies, collect game-changing power ups, and use upgrades to get stronger and deadlier. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready for the ultimate Meowtastic Mayhem!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeat 30 dino waves and one final boss wave. Grr. <br />\r\nMewMew is on top of his omnipotent dominance. Demonstrate this with Ego Boost, that amplifies your arsenal of upgrades and doubles your killing scores when activated. <br />\r\nIncrease your Ego Status by killing enemies. <br />\r\nJuice up your arsenal by collecting power ups around the map. <br />\r\nBetween every other wave, choose from dozens of upgrades, or even upgrade your upgrades! Find your favorite combination of upgrades and power ups and develop your build on your way to victory. <br />\r\nCompete with your dino killer colleagues with the Friends Leaderboard. See how you fare in the Local Leaderboard. Prove yourself and rise in the Global Leaderboard.",
    "about_the_game": "You know what really killed the dinosaurs? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMewMew PewPew is a wave-based arena shooter, where you play as MewMew, whose home is invaded by vengeful dinosaurs. Destroy your enemies, collect game-changing power ups, and use upgrades to get stronger and deadlier. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nGet ready for the ultimate Meowtastic Mayhem!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBeat 30 dino waves and one final boss wave. Grr. <br />\r\nMewMew is on top of his omnipotent dominance. Demonstrate this with Ego Boost, that amplifies your arsenal of upgrades and doubles your killing scores when activated. <br />\r\nIncrease your Ego Status by killing enemies. <br />\r\nJuice up your arsenal by collecting power ups around the map. <br />\r\nBetween every other wave, choose from dozens of upgrades, or even upgrade your upgrades! Find your favorite combination of upgrades and power ups and develop your build on your way to victory. <br />\r\nCompete with your dino killer colleagues with the Friends Leaderboard. See how you fare in the Local Leaderboard. Prove yourself and rise in the Global Leaderboard.",
    "short_description": "The dinosaurs have brought the fight to the wrong cat\u2019s territory. Mess with MewMew, get the PewPew: It\u2019s time to send the dinos right back to extinction.",
